      <description>&lt;p&gt;We warmly welcome &lt;strong&gt;Prof. Yuhan Liu&lt;/strong&gt;, Associate Professor from &lt;strong&gt;Harbin Institute of Technology (HIT)&lt;/strong&gt;, for a research visit to SCALE in &lt;strong&gt;July 2026&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Armin Lederer, Lei Zheng, Zhihua Wu, and Tharusha Fonseka look forward to meeting with Prof. Liu to discuss learning-based control, robotics, and safe autonomy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about Prof. Liu at &lt;a href=&#34;https://homepage.hit.edu.cn/liuyuhan?lang=en&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;https://homepage.hit.edu.cn/liuyuhan?lang=en&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
